  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: 'How the... *sigh* I knew the code was too easy to guess.

      Oh,
      well, at least it wasn''t <b>him</b> who figured it out.

      So what''s
      your deal? Are you a reporter? A spy? An officer? What should I do with you?'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962644
    - rid: 3046478613006778468
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 135.0954, y: 189.25099}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046478908010004712
    guid:
      Part1: 3894623799
      Part2: 1148273472
      Part3: 897015966
      Part4: 2381907516
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'So he trusts you, then. And yet he felt like he had no reason
      to tell me about you.

      Seriously, why do i seem to be the only one who
      knows how to do my job properly?

      Ok, so then you must have come here
      looking for something. Be quick.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778473
    - rid: 3046478613006778474
    - rid: 3046478613006778475
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1175, y: -6.11998}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 86385421
      Part2: 1187369203
      Part3: 2302744214
      Part4: 3982707328
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, you''re the first and only person to come into this room,
      so nothing''s gone wrong so far.

      Though, of course, I didn''t account
      on you being a part of this so, please don''t get in the way.

      This is
      a very serious business for me, alright?'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778477
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2248.6045, y: -355.39243}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2757100495
      Part2: 1337091679
      Part3: 2331423645
      Part4: 1363973298
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Then do me a favour and remind him that I said MANY TIMES that
      I would be the one taking care of that.

      And make sure that he keeps
      in mind that he''s in debt with me, and that he''s still <b>alive</b> for a
      reason.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778479
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2249, y: -66}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3989213569
      Part2: 1292918822
      Part3: 1822912920
      Part4: 1958942294
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...Please tell me you''re joking. There must have been a good
      reason for Oleg to let you in, and clearly your intelligence is not it.

      Look,
      just... stay out of this, alright? Clearly you''re not very well prepared,
      and you could easily get caught in the crossfire, so it''s better if you don''t
      get involved.'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778478
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2222.6602, y: 205}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 194430029
      Part2: 1159268048
      Part3: 39248061
      Part4: 1598397460
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'If that''s the case, from one spy to another, none of this shouldn''t
      be of your concern.

      You''re smart, I respect that, so I''ll tell you
      this: we''re not here to kill anyone.

      i''ll let this slide, but if you
      dare enter here again... let''s just say it will no longer be a murder "attempt",
      get what I''m saying?.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778470
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1259, y: 495.00003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2855662127
      Part2: 1111791029
      Part3: 3840308662
      Part4: 1349355998
    tag: 
